    "title": "M1 execution subset",
    "version": "0.0.3",
    "description": "Curated from Backend report 648f2b21-fa25-4d03-b827-9b5450f24836. Proposed; no validator/tests. SEC OPEN; policies deferred; B05 blocked. UI reads/creation schema updates outstanding. Orbit narrows POST200 to committed schema; GET200 retains status union."
